# Optional: sign in with email or Google (Privy). Leave empty and the page simply has no such option.
# Create an app at https://dashboard.privy.io, enable Email and Google, add your site's addresses under
# "Allowed origins" (for example http://localhost:5188 and https://chog-choir.vercel.app), then paste its App ID here.
VITE_PRIVY_APP_ID=
# Which methods to offer: "email" (default) or "email,google". Only methods switched on in the Privy dashboard work,
# so add google here only after enabling Google under Login methods in the dashboard.
VITE_PRIVY_METHODS=email
